.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt X509_STORE_TRUST_MTC_CA 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm X509_STORE_trust_mtc_ca
.Nd trust a Merkle Tree Certificate authority in a certificate store
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Lb libcrypto
.In openssl/x509_vfy.h
.Ft int
.Fo X509_STORE_trust_mtc_ca
.Fa "X509_STORE *store"
.Fa "OSSL_MTC_CA *ca"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn X509_STORE_trust_mtc_ca
adds
.Fa ca
to the Merkle Tree Certificate authorities that
.Fa store
trusts, so that Merkle Tree Certificates issued by that CA verify against
.Fa store .
A CA whose trust anchor identifier equals that of one already added is
rejected.
.Pp
.Fa store
does not take ownership of
.Fa ca
and does not free it.
.Fa ca
must remain valid for as long as
.Fa store
exists.
The caller keeps its pointer and may go on configuring the CA with
.Xr OSSL_MTC_CA_load_landmarks 3
while it is trusted.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn X509_STORE_trust_mtc_ca
returns 1 on success or 0 on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr OSSL_MTC_CA_new 3 ,
.Xr OSSL_MTC_CA_parse_certificates 3 ,
.Xr X509_STORE_new 3 ,
.Xr X509_STORE_set1_param 3
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
